{
  "id": "universal-asdi",
  "name": "Automatic SDI (ASDI)",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": "all",
  "goal": "Shift your position at the end of hitlag",
  "why": "A weak hit lifts you off the floor, and the opponent can hit you again before you land. Held down through hitlag, the C-stick puts {char} back on the floor at once, able to act after the normal landing lag while the opponent is still in its attack.",
  "tutorial": {
    "what": "ASDI shifts {char} 3 units toward the C-stick as hitlag ends. Held down, it puts {char} back on the floor.",
    "expect": "Each hit is judged after hitlag: whether {char} was on the floor when hitlag ended, and how soon {char} jumped or shielded out of the landing.",
    "example": [
      {
        "cstick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": "HIT+1",
        "hold": "HL"
      },
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": "HIT+HL+LAND",
        "hold": 1
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "HIT": "Frame {HIT}: {move} hits. Hitlag: {HL} frames",
      "HIT+1": "Frame {HIT+1}: the C-stick is pressed down and held",
      "HIT+HL-1": "Frame {HIT+HL-1}: the last frame of hitlag. The game reads the C-stick",
      "HIT+HL": "Frame {HIT+HL}: shifted 3 units down. {char} lands",
      "HIT+HL+LAND": "Frame {HIT+HL+LAND}: the landing lag is over. Jump"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "ASDI",
        "text": [
          "The game reads the C-stick on the last frame of hitlag: past 70% of its reach, it shifts {char} 3 units toward it. Short of that, the control stick is used if past 70%; it also turns the launch angle (DI).",
          "The down tilt lifts {char} off the floor. Held down, the C-stick shifts {char} back down, and {char} lands at once. Press it during hitlag: standing, the C-stick down is a down smash."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "cstick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": 6,
                "hold": 5
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "5": "Frame 5: the down tilt hits. Hitlag: 5 frames",
              "6": "Frame 6: the C-stick is pressed down and held",
              "9": "Frame 9: the last frame of hitlag. The game reads the C-stick",
              "10": "Frame 10: shifted 3 units down. {char} lands at once"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  5,
                  8
                ],
                "words": "Hitlag: press the C-stick down and hold it",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  9,
                  9
                ],
                "words": "Last frame of hitlag: the C-stick is read now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  10,
                  11
                ],
                "words": "Hitlag over: too late",
                "kind": "late"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  12,
                  30
                ],
                "words": "On the floor",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Out of the landing",
        "text": "After ASDI down, {char} is in a landing that can be left after the normal landing lag: {LAND} frames. Press jump or shield once, right as it ends. A press during the landing lag is ignored, and holding it does not carry over.",
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "cstick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": 6,
                "hold": 5
              },
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": "10+LAND",
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "10": "Frame 10: {char} lands. Landing lag: {LAND} frames",
              "10+LAND": "Frame {10+LAND}: the landing lag is over. Jump"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  10,
                  "9+LAND"
                ],
                "words": "Landing lag: a press here is ignored",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "10+LAND",
                  "15+LAND"
                ],
                "words": "Jump or shield now",
                "kind": "go"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
